  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, boil the pork bones in 4 quarts of water for 4 hours to make the broth.",
    "Strain the broth and discard the bones.",
    "Add the brewed genmaicha tea to the broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "Cook the shirataki noodles according to the package instructions and set aside.",
    "Slice the chicken breast into thin strips and cook in the broth for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sesame oil, soy sauce, salt, and black pepper to the broth and stir to combine.",
    "To assemble the ramen, place some noodles in a tagliere vessel, then add sliced chicken and green onions.",
    "Ladle the hot genmaicha broth over the top and serve immediately."
